    "$\\neg ( \\forall x ) ( \\exists y ) [ ( a ( x , y ) \\land b ( x , y ) ) \\to c ( x , y ) ]$",
    "−(∀x)(=∃y)[(a(x, y) ∨ b(x, y) → c(x, y)]"
   ],
